# Monopoly house, toppled: the green game house (monopoly_house) knocked over onto its side, its roof towards +x. It rests on
# the edge of its roof and on one bottom edge of its walls, so it lies a little tipped up, showing its front door (+z) sideways.
format 1
collider mesh

# Half the vertices its size would give it, and its parts half too: big, simple forms, and dozens of game pieces lie on the
# board
Detail detail=0.5
    # Turned 77° about z, which brings the roof's eave and the walls' bottom edge on that side level with each other: lifted by
    # the amount that rests it on the ground, less a few centimetres sunk into it
    Translate translation=(0, 1.28, 0)
        Rotate rotation=(0, 0, -1.35)
            Part part=monopoly_house
